{{also|burger|Bürger}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Back-formation from {{term|hamburger}}, as if it were {{term|ham}} + {{term|-burger|lang=en}}.

===Suffix===
{{infl|en|suffix|sort=burger}}

# Used to make the names of [[hamburger]]s served in [[bun]]s with the addition of the specified [[foodstuff]], or with that foodstuff used in place of the usual meat.

